---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-image">
   <img
  src={`${base}images/hero.jpg`}
  alt="People in Centre field work"
/>
  </div>
  
   <p class="hero-tagline">
     <h2>Shifting the focus from infrastructure to people, from projects to processes,
     from delivery to participation.</h2>
   </p>

  <p class="hero-intro">
    <strong>People in Centre (PiC)</strong> works to place people at the heart of
    development, recovery and change. We support communities,
    governments and development partners in creating resilient,
    sustainable and inclusive solutions through work on resilience,
    ecological balance, urban space and capacity building.
  </p>

</section>


